1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,590
I mean, I would say the best thing about maturing is I think you should start to feel good more.

2
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:05,770
You start to feel more at peace.

3
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:10,130
You start feeling less frantic because you're not fighting the path.

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,490
You just save more energy.

5
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:12,870
You just feel like lighter.

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:22,490
The worst part is letting go of people, giving yourself grace and forgiveness for the ways you were operating when you weren't mature.

7
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:23,910
Not even just when you weren't mature.

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:29,750
It's not as if you flipped a switch, but, you know, just your process and taking the opportunity when you can to atone for that.

9
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:32,310
And I will say this, though, not everybody deserves a whole atonement.

10
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:37,170
I've had people be like, I met you in 2006 at Boston University and you was stank.

11
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,450
And I can tell that you still got stankness.

12
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:42,070
And then somebody was like, you know, you owe them an apology.

13
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:44,630
And it's like, well, you're not getting an apology when you come at me like that.

14
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,430
I ain't that mature.

